{"id":"00497","root":"uni00497_1","name":{"ja":"ふうま　災禍","en":"Fuuma Saika"},"title":{"ja":"【ラグジュアバニー】","en":"【Luxury Bunny】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ラグジュアバニー】 ふうま　災禍","en":"【Luxury Bunny】 Fuuma Saika"},"aliases":["Demon Saika"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2021-08-16","limited":true,"characterId":39,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま弾正の秘書を行っていた女性。代々ふうまに仕えている正式な秘書の一族で、彼女自身にもふうまの血が入っている。左目に邪眼を有し、目が合った相手の視界と意識を乗っ取るという強力な能力を持つ。しかしこの邪眼を使っている最中は全神経を使うため、彼女は動くことができない。かつては亡き弾正に忠誠を誓い、対魔忍として活躍もしていたが、魔族との戦闘中に両足を奪われた。その後弾正に救出されて共に米連に逃げ延び、米連のサイボーグ技術による機械の足を得て対魔忍に復帰するが、弾正が反乱を企んでいることを知ると、彼のもとを離れた。その後は対魔忍として任務に就きながら、弾正亡き後のふうま家に仕える。しかし秘書としての立場からは一歩退き、新たな当主である小太郎の補佐は時子に任せ、自身は弾正が遺した書物の管理などの仕事をしている。危険なドラッグが蔓延するクラブに潜入し、首謀者を排除するという任務についた災禍。従業員のバニーガールに変装し、入り込んだのだが……。","en":"She served as the secretary to Fuuma Danjo. She comes from a hereditary line of official secretaries who have served the Fuuma family for generations, and she herself carries Fuuma blood. She possesses an evil eye in her left eye, a powerful ability that hijacks the vision and consciousness of anyone who meets her gaze. However, while using this evil eye she expends all her nerves and cannot move. She once swore loyalty to the late Danjo and was active as a Taimanin, but lost both legs in battle with demons. She was rescued by Danjo and escaped together to the United States, where she obtained cybernetic legs via American technology and returned to being a Taimanin. When she learned Danjo was plotting a rebellion, she left his side. Afterwards she served the Fuuma family as a Taimanin while stepping back from her secretary role, leaving the new head Kotaro's assistance to Tokiko and handling the books Danjo left behind. She infiltrated a club plagued by dangerous drugs to eliminate its mastermind, disguising herself as a bunny girl."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"有賀桃","forms":[{"id":"uni00497_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1096,2192],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[153,306],"def":[109,218],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","1160007"]},{"id":"uni00497_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1692,3384],"sp":[210,210],"atk":[241,482],"def":[153,306],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","1160007","1160008"]},{"id":"uni00497_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2288,4582],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[334,669],"def":[202,402],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","1160007","1160008"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},"1160007":{"slot":"skill1","id":1160007,"name":{"ja":"ムーンサルト"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 105% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":2,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 108% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 111% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":4,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 114% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 117% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},"1160008":{"slot":"skill2","id":1160008,"name":{"ja":"斬月蹴"},"hits":4,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 600% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"Self: take 30% of max HP as damage","tag":"instant"}]},{"level":2,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に